+// sessions S31 (BACKLOG S-147, docs/history/plan-2026-09-26.md SPC-23): with
+// "Continue where you left off", a session cookie -- one with no expiry, as
+// many sign-ins are -- comes back after a restart in a Space's own jar, as it
+// does in the profile's jar. Only the profile's jar kept its session cookies:
+// every other partition, a Space's among them, was made with session cookies
+// neither written to disk nor read back, so a Space with its own session was
+// signed out of such a site at every restart while a shared Space was not.
